# Entity Framework Core

## Naming conventions

- **Migration script naming** - use pattern `<FolderNumber>_<Layer>_<EntityName>[_<comment_if_required>]`

Example:
```
1_PreDeployment/1_00_predeployment.sql
4_SeedData/4_01_lead_providers.sql
```

## Migrations

- **Versioning** - use numbering for migration versioning
- **Comments** - add comments to the file name when needed
- **PreDeployment immutability** - never edit, rename, or delete scripts under `*/1_PreDeployment/`; append the next numbered script with the delta only. Full workflow: skill `cross-identity-db-scripts`.
